WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.370
ARIA helps you inspect the reasoning
behind a

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:07.090
market read. Confirm the market and
timeframe, then

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.510
open ARIA. Read the observed conditions.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.390
Inspect one matched check and the evidence
behind

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:16.230
it. Then open an unmet condition and read

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:16.810
what is missing.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.970
In this illustrative example, six of ten
checks

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.710
match and the verdict is wait.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:25.190
Matching other checks does not erase
contradictory evidence

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.390
or remove restrictions.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:29.750
Leave the ticket alone, explain why you
waited,

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.610
and bring your reasoning to the lesson.

